[38;2;124;124;124mambiguous). However, we can modify the algorithm to detect decimal fractions... [0m[38;2;124;124;124mbut detecting whether a computable number is a decimal fraction is itself [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mundecidable in general.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mSo under the uniform interpretation, the answer is more nuanced. But I think the[0m[38;2;124;124;124mnon-uniform interpretation (for each computable number, there exists a TM) is [0m
